    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>[h2][b]OFFICE MANAGEMENT[/b][/h2]\n[img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130730/extras/01.gif?t=1725278516\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" /></span>[/img]\nStyle your office to be a beautiful and productive working environment. Place your products where you want them to be and design a seamless experience for your orders.\n\n[b][h2]SUPPLY GOODS[/h2][/b]\n[img][/img]\nOrder items using the in-game computer. Place the goods on the shelves, organize them in your office and put them on sale in your online store.\n\n[h2][b]ON SALE[/b][/h2]\n[img][/img]\nDetermine the value of the product correctly and ensure that customer comments remain positive.\n\n[b][h2]SHIPPED[/h2][/b]\n[img][/img]\nShip the purchased products and deliver them to the cargo vehicle to reach the customers.\n\n[h2][b]PROLOGUE[/b][/h2]\nContents such as hiring workers, boxing tables, computers, opening new shops and warehouses are not available in this prologue. If you liked this prologue, which focuses on the extensive gameplay of the game's ordering <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130730/extras/01.gif?t=1725278516\" /></span><br>Style your office to be a beautiful and productive working environment. Place your products where you want them to be and design a seamless experience for your orders.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPPLY GOODS</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130730/extras/04.gif?t=1725278516\" /></span><br>Order items using the in-game computer. Place the goods on the shelves, organize them in your office and put them on sale in your online store.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ON SALE</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130730/extras/05.gif?t=1725278516\" /></span><br>Determine the value of the product correctly and ensure that customer comments remain positive.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIPPED</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130730/extras/03.gif?t=1725278516\" /></span><br>Ship the purchased products and deliver them to the cargo vehicle to reach the customers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROLOGUE</strong></h2>Contents such as hiring workers, boxing tables, computers, opening new shops and warehouses are not available in this prologue. If you liked this prologue, which focuses on the extensive gameplay of the game's ordering and shipping mechanics, you can add it to your wish list by going to the full version page within the game.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OFFICE MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130730/extras/01.gif?t=1725278516\" /></span><br>Style your office to be a beautiful and productive working environment. Place your products where you want them to be and design a seamless experience for your orders.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPPLY GOODS</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130730/extras/04.gif?t=1725278516\" /></span><br>Order items using the in-game computer. Place the goods on the shelves, organize them in your office and put them on sale in your online store.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ON SALE</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130730/extras/05.gif?t=1725278516\" /></span><br>Determine the value of the product correctly and ensure that customer comments remain positive.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIPPED</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130730/extras/03.gif?t=1725278516\" /></span><br>Ship the purchased products and deliver them to the cargo vehicle to reach the customers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROLOGUE</strong></h2>Contents such as hiring workers, boxing tables, computers, opening new shops and warehouses are not available in this prologue. If you liked this prologue, which focuses on the extensive gameplay of the game's ordering and shipping mechanics, you can add it to your wish list by going to the full version page within the game.",
